abstract: >-
  Reproducible AI-assisted Earthquake Early Warning (EEW) research for Western
  seismic regions, developed in the context of a Swiss certificate programme
  (Assessment and Management of Geological and Climate Related Risk). Europe is
  the long-term research focus; a completed California IRIS/EarthScope FDSN
  pilot (eight events, 8×18 feature matrix) demonstrates the acquisition,
  analysis, and reporting workflow. Version 2.0 adds an interactive Next.js
  research platform under website/.
